note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Fixed 8-word launch record for the elementwise API. No data view: the caller
note keeps pointer acquisition and the launch. kind 0 is a 1d chunk (n is the
note remaining element count, p0 unused). kind 1 is a rope head chunk (n is the
note remaining head count, p0 is head_dim). kind 2 is an rmsnorm row chunk
note (n is the remaining row count). p0 is eps bits, p1 is dim.
note kind 2 rec 1 is dim/128, rec 2 is the f32 bits of 1/dim, rec 3 eps bits, rec 4 dim.
note WolframLanguageEvaluator: FromDigits[RealDigits[1.0, 2][[1]][[2 ;; 24]], 2] + 127*2^23 -> 1065353216.
note rec 0 count, rec 1 grid or half, rec 2..5 params, rec 6 threads, rec 7 grid.
note Caps: 1024 CTAs, 128 threads, chunk 131072. WolframLanguageEvaluator: 1024*128 -> 131072.
note head_dim is even, 2..2048.
fn av_ewarg kind ulong n ulong p0 ulong p1 ulong rec edit ulong 8 to ulong
if eq n 0
ret 1
end
put rec 3 0
put rec 4 0
put rec 5 0
put rec 7 0
if eq kind 0
ni = n
if gt ni 131072
ni = 131072
end
put rec 0 ni
put rec 1 div add ni 127 128
put rec 2 ni
put rec 6 128
ret 0
end
if eq kind 1
if lt p0 2
ret 1
end
if ne and p0 1 0
ret 1
end
if gt p0 2048
ret 1
end
nh = n
if gt nh 1024
nh = 1024
end
hf = div p0 2
put rec 0 nh
put rec 1 hf
put rec 2 p0
put rec 3 hf
put rec 6 hf
put rec 7 nh
ret 0
end
if eq kind 2
if eq p1 0
ret 1
end
if gt p1 16384
ret 1
end
nr = n
if gt nr 1024
nr = 1024
end
one = bitcast f32 uint 1065353216
inv = div f32 one f32 p1
put rec 0 nr
put rec 1 div p1 128
put rec 2 ulong bitcast uint inv
put rec 3 p0
put rec 4 p1
put rec 6 128
put rec 7 nr
ret 0
end
ret 1
end
